# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — W3 junk_check 回退整仓扫描连坐其他库历史基线 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-01
# Software: libpopcnt 2.0
# Gate: W3 local CI / build_and_test.sh junk_check
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-libpopcnt-2.0-w3-baseline-junk-check-full-scan
severity: 2
category: ci|junk-check|baseline-noise
trigger_tool: build_and_test.sh|junk_check.sh|run_local_ci
phase: w3-local-ci
approach: 将 W3 junk_check 作用域有界到当前库 diff；对其他库历史基线噪音用精确
  隔离/恢复证据豁免，不改当前库配方、不删除路径、不设全局忽略

keywords: junk_check, JC_RESULT=fail, full scan, git ls-files, .staging-verified,
  .progress-closed, .recipe-marker, .manifest-complete, baseline noise, W3,
  L0_RESULT=fail, unrelated library, whole-repo scan

error_signature: JC_RESULT=fail|JC1: .*被跟踪|JC3: .*tarball.*被跟踪|JC5: .*未登记的隐藏文件|L0_RESULT=fail: junk_check failed|检查模式: full
match_keywords: junk_check, JC_RESULT=fail, full, git ls-files, .staging-verified,
  .progress-closed, baseline

root_cause: junk_check.sh 范围三优先级 prdiff -> incremental(git diff
  origin/main...HEAD) -> full(git ls-files 整仓)。执行端适配分支未 commit 时
  HEAD==origin/main，diff 为空导致静默回退 full 整仓扫描，把其他库历史已提交的
  状态/垃圾文件（.staging-verified/.progress-closed/.recipe-marker/
  .manifest-complete/tarball 等）全部纳入检查，命中即阻塞当前库 W3/finish，
  而当前库自身 Adapt 已通过。这些基线路径不在当前库 diff 内，属连坐阻塞。
affected_scope: 所有 diff 为空或未 commit 的本地适配分支执行 W3 本地 CI 模拟；
  仓库含历史提交的 archives 状态文件/tarball 时整仓扫描必然复现

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: 1) 定位 R02 W3 日志中 JC1/JC3/JC5 列出的精确无关路径；2) 逐条
  记录发现命令、tracked 状态、提交基线（git log）、隔离前 SHA-256；3) 临时移到
  worktree 外隔离目录，用当前库 PR-diff 作用域（JUNK_PR_DIFF 仅含当前库文件）
  重跑受影响的 W3 门禁；4) 原样恢复并核对恢复后 SHA-256 与 git 原子性；5) 证明
  无基线文件属于当前库 diff。治理根治方向是让 junk_check 在有界当前库 diff
  上运行，禁止整仓回退连坐。
rec_description: 精确 baseline-noise 隔离/恢复 + 当前库 diff 有界 W3 重跑
rec_command: git ls-files --error-unmatch <path> && git log -1 -- <path> &&
  sha256sum <path> && mv <path> <out-of-worktree-isolate> && JUNK_PR_DIFF=<pr.diff>
  python3 scripts/ohc-run.py ... && mv <isolate>/<path> <path> && sha256sum <path>
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: baseline-noise-exemption

doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-libpopcnt-2.0-w3-baseline-junk-check-full-scan.md

principles: P004, P010

